1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Software" means Deck Advisor in any form we make available, including
    its executable files, compiled and bundled code, embedded user
    interface, assets, documentation, and any updates, patches or new
    versions we provide.

1.2 "Proprietary Logic" means the methods, rules, models, weightings,
    scoring formulas, heuristics, indexes and data structures the Software
    uses to read cards, assess synergy, rank and explain suggestions,
    identify combos and their status, assess what a new set changes, and
    analyze decks, together with the code that implements them.

1.3 "Third-Party Content" means content the Software downloads or displays
    that belongs to others, including Magic: The Gathering card names,
    rules text, card images, mana symbols and other materials owned by
    Wizards of the Coast LLC; card data and images provided by Scryfall;
    combo definitions provided by Commander Spellbook; and deck lists
    provided by MTGJSON.


