6. DATA AND PRIVACY

The Software runs on your computer and stores your decks, collection and
settings locally. It does not collect, transmit or sell your personal data,
and it contains no analytics or tracking. It connects to the internet only
to download Third-Party Content from the services named in Section 5.3.


